ll group of people out  there that sort of appreciate sort of  the things i've done in terms of um  breaking down some barriers and setting  new standards about what's possible for  a young  native american kid out there that wants  to be in broadcasting that wants to be  in professional sports that wants to go  to a school like stanford and get an  economics degree and that that's really  all i'm trying to do i i don't  approach life with any expectation i  just try and do the best i can with what  i have and the opportunities that are  given me to try and get more of these  young native kids that are facing some  pretty dire circumstance in their own  life on a day-to-day basis a chance to  dream big and hopefully you know do what  they need to do  um to reach their dreams  always great to talk to you thanks for  joining us yeah it's great being on your  show dan  have a great weekend that's uh no to  begin golf channel analyst live from the  masters


